  "body": "A per-operation post must refuse a missing default machine file before writing NC. The refusal now names the setup and file but omits the affected operation.\n\nThe existing regression a_missing_default_machine_file_refuses_the_post_per_operation expects the name Face2. The refusal reports the machine of Setup2. The same test fails on the #2948 trial merge with main at 1d81b609c. The machine template does not change the refusal path.\n\nThe shared verification check already collects the operations that require the default machine. Include the affected operation name in its error and keep the setup and machine filename. Preserve refusal for a missing or malformed machine. Add a regression for the per-operation command that checks the setup, operation, machine filename, failure status and absence of NC output.\n\nRelated work: #2319 and #2321. Suggested labels are P2, effort:medium, area:post, bug and source:agent.\n",
